    "optional_packages_comment": "Installed only when setup is asked for the extras. Reading is markitdown, which is Microsoft's own tool and covers docx, pdf, xlsx, pptx, html and csv in one call. Writing has no Microsoft equivalent, so the format libraries do it. Deliberately absent: pytesseract and pdf2image, which need Tesseract and Poppler binaries this toolkit does not install, and pymupdf, which is AGPL and needs a licence review before company use.",
    "optional_packages": [
